WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
Alex: One more thing. Have you dry-run it first?
还有一件事。你们先试跑过吗？

2
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:09.167
Priya: Yes. On staging, twice. The last one was clean.
跑过。在预发布环境两次。最后一次干净。

3
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:11.639
Alex: Good. And if the first pool fails?
好。那如果第一个池失败呢？

4
00:00:11.639 --> 00:00:16.078
Priya: Then we abort the rollout. No debate.
那就中止这轮发布。不讨论。

5
00:00:16.078 --> 00:00:19.294
Sam: We've agreed the call is Priya's.
我们说好了由 Priya 拍板。

6
00:00:19.294 --> 00:00:21.358
Alex: Okay. How long to abort?
好。中止要多久？

7
00:00:21.358 --> 00:00:25.798
Priya: Two minutes to stop. Twenty to roll back.
停下来两分钟。回滚二十分钟。

8
00:00:25.798 --> 00:00:29.301
Alex: Fine. I have a hard stop at four, so keep it tight.
行。我四点必须走，所以节奏紧凑点。

9
00:00:29.301 --> 00:00:32.085
Priya: We'll be done by three thirty.
我们三点半前结束。

10
00:00:32.085 --> 00:00:35.037
Alex: Good. One last thing — do the app teams know?
好。最后一件事——应用团队知道了吗？

11
00:00:35.037 --> 00:00:39.668
Sam: Yes. And we will be doing the comms with them.
知道。我们会跟他们一起发通知。

12
00:00:39.668 --> 00:00:42.620
Alex: Then you have approval. Just keep the channel updated.
那批准了。保持频道更新就行。

